<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Larscom Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Larscom Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name				 Larscom Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol				  LARS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range		     $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total Class A shares to be offered     7.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company		    5.8 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholder --*	  1.2 million</p>
<p>Class A Shrs outstanding after ipo     7.0 million</p>
<p>Class B Shrs outstanding after ipo    10.7 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter			 Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment	     1.05 million</p>
<p>--* selling shareholder is Axel Johnson Inc.</p>
<p>Business: Santa Clara, Calif.-based company develops, manufactures and markets a broad range of high speed global internetworking solutions for network service providers and corporate users.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For repayment of $25 million of indebtedness to the selling stockholder and general corporate purposes, including working capital.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $48,663	     $36,550</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $2,529		 $661</p>
